{
  "declaredLength": 2152,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>产生反应，\n部分电源启动了……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E00100002010000004EA7751F53CD5E94FF0C000A90E8520675356E90542F52A84E8620262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "进行安全检查……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n已确认对应的超级石……\n重启部分系统。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDB884C5B89516868C067E52026202600100001BE01000A5DF2786E8BA45BF95E9476848D857EA777F320262026000A91CD542F90E852067CFB7EDF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M项目启动。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n此项目十分危险，\n要解除锁定吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D987976EE542F52A8300200100001BE01000A6B64987976EE5341520653719669FF0C000A898189E3966495015B9A5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "解除",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89E396640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你啊，\n这是在搞什么呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF400100002010000004F60554AFF0C000A8FD9662F5728641E4EC04E485462FF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "居然要和超梦这种\n危险的宝可梦对峙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C4571368981548C8D8568A68FD979CD000A5371966976845B9D53EF68A65BF95CD9300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你必须捉到它哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605FC5987B634952305B8354E6FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你必须捉到超梦哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605FC5987B634952308D8568A654E6FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "梦～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "68A6FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我都说了\n你必须捉到超梦啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190FD8BF44E86000A4F605FC5987B634952308D8568A6554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我都说了\n你必须捉到超梦啊！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你不能仗着自己厉害就打倒它！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190FD8BF44E86000A4F605FC5987B634952308D8568A6554AFF0100100001BE00000A4F604E0D80FD4ED7774081EA5DF153895BB35C31625350125B83FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你帮我捉到它了啊，\n稍等一下哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F605E2E6211634952305B834E86554AFF0C000A7A0D7B494E004E0B54E6300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每次看到这里的情况，\n我都会有种难以言喻的心情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF6B21770B52308FD991CC768460C551B5FF0C000A621190FD4F1A670979CD96BE4EE58A0055BB76845FC360C5300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我试着用了全息影像，\n因为光通话太没意思啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BD5774075284E865168606F5F7150CFFF0C000A56E04E3A5149901A8BDD592A6CA1610F601D5566300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为什么会在弗拉达利研究所\n和超梦对战，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我来给你说明一下吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4EC04E484F1A57285F1762C98FBE522978147A766240000A548C8D8568A65BF96218FF0C00100001BE00000A621167657ED94F608BF4660E4E004E0B5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "难道是你太闲了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96BE9053662F4F60592A95F24E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这才对嘛，\n人最重要的就是坦率。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9624D5BF9561BFF0C000A4EBA670091CD898176845C31662F57667387300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然你的回答不按常理出牌，\n但我不计较，还是给你说明一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71364F60768456DE7B544E0D63095E38740651FA724CFF0C000A4F4662114E0D8BA18F83FF0C8FD8662F7ED94F608BF4660E4E004E0B5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超梦是由研究宝可梦\n遗传基因的科学家<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n创造出来的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D8568A6662F753178147A765B9D53EF68A6000A90574F2057FA56E0768479D15B665BB600100001BE00000A521B902051FA676576845B9D53EF68A6300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它隐藏着强大的能量，\n连闪焰队也很关注<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n能否把它用在最终兵器上。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83969085CF77405F3A5927768480FD91CFFF0C000A8FDE95EA7130961F4E5F5F8851736CE800100001BE00000A80FD5426628A5B837528572867007EC8517556684E0A300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就在这时，闪焰队获得了超梦在\n卡洛斯地区的无名洞窟出现的消息，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n于是就捕获了它。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3157288FD965F6FF0C95EA7130961F83B75F974E868D8568A65728000A53616D1B65AF5730533A768465E0540D6D1E7A9F51FA73B076846D88606FFF0C00100001BE00000A4E8E662F5C31635583B74E865B83300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超梦为什么会在卡洛斯地区出现，\n还是个未解之谜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D8568A64E3A4EC04E484F1A572853616D1B65AF5730533A51FA73B0FF0C000A8FD8662F4E2A672A89E34E4B8C1C300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有种说法认为它可能是\n在寻求超级进化的能力。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n可就算我们5个人合力\n也没能解开关于超梦的谜题。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670979CD8BF46CD58BA44E3A5B8353EF80FD662F000A57285BFB6C428D857EA78FDB5316768480FD529B300200100001BE01000A53EF5C317B9762114EEC00354E2A4EBA5408529B000A4E5F6CA180FD89E35F0051734E8E8D8568A676848C1C9898300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为就算使用了超梦进化石X\n和超梦进化石Y这两种超级石，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也无法让超梦超级进化。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A5C317B974F7F75284E868D8568A68FDB531677F30058000A548C8D8568A68FDB531677F300598FD94E2479CD8D857EA777F3FF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F65E06CD58BA98D8568A68D857EA78FDB5316300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超梦平时也在为战斗积蓄能量，\n因此一动不动。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D8568A65E7365F64E5F57284E3A6218659779EF84C480FD91CFFF0C000A56E06B644E0052A84E0D52A8300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M项目就这样冻结了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D987976EE5C318FD9683751BB7ED34E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说起未解之谜，\n这次超梦产生反应也是个谜啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF48D77672A89E34E4B8C1CFF0C000A8FD96B218D8568A64EA7751F53CD5E944E5F662F4E2A8C1C554A300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也许它对你拥有的\n超梦进化石X和超梦进化石Y<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n产生了反应吧，但是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8BB85B835BF94F6062E567097684000A8D8568A68FDB531677F30058548C8D8568A68FDB531677F3005900100001BE00000A4EA7751F4E8653CD5E945427FF0C4F46662F2026202600100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样一来，下一个问题就是\n你为什么会拥有2种超级石，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是太不可思议了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E006765FF0C4E0B4E004E2A95EE98985C31662F000A4F604E3A4EC04E484F1A62E56709003279CD8D857EA777F3FF0C00100001BE00000A771F662F592A4E0D53EF601D8BAE4E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无所谓啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E062408C135566300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像你这么高水平的训练家，\n超梦应该也会心甘情愿地听话吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF4F608FD94E489AD86C345E7376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A8D8568A65E948BE54E5F4F1A5FC3751860C5613F5730542C8BDD5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我这个代理所长也有不少事要做，\n挂了哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118FD94E2A4EE374066240957F4E5F67094E0D5C114E8B8981505AFF0C000A63024E8654E6FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    }
  ],
